{"2560720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Akasha: 32-MECHA", "steam_appid": 2560720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> 32</strong> player story that unfolds over <strong>3 </strong>real-world days, converging into one shared story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>&quot;2nd-person&quot;</strong> combat system, featuring a combination of <strong>shooter</strong> and <strong>melee</strong> gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300 Years Ago</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower was discovered during maritime exploration. Early human expeditions vanished without a trace, cementing its reputation as a place of mystery, danger, and legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 Years Ago</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With advances in AI, autonomous robots were deployed into the Tower to explore its depths. However, all attempts failed. Traditional wireless communication was disrupted inside the Tower, and no meaningful data was ever recovered, leaving its interior a complete unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Present Day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advancements in neutrino communication enabled the development of the Akasha System, allowing humans to remotely pilot &quot;S.S.Frames&quot; into the Tower. These expeditions have uncovered extraordinary resources: plants that extend human lifespan, and vast, untapped energy sources. In response, the Tower Delver Organization was founded to manage exploration and extract these valuable discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Welcome Recruit&quot;</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> 32</strong> player story that unfolds over <strong>3 </strong>real-world days, converging into one shared story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>&quot;2nd-person&quot;</strong> combat system, featuring a combination of <strong>shooter</strong> and <strong>melee</strong> gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300 Years Ago</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower was discovered during maritime exploration. Early human expeditions vanished without a trace, cementing its reputation as a place of mystery, danger, and legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 Years Ago</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With advances in AI, autonomous robots were deployed into the Tower to explore its depths. However, all attempts failed. Traditional wireless communication was disrupted inside the Tower, and no meaningful data was ever recovered, leaving its interior a complete unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Present Day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advancements in neutrino communication enabled the development of the Akasha System, allowing humans to remotely pilot &quot;S.S.Frames&quot; into the Tower. These expeditions have uncovered extraordinary resources: plants that extend human lifespan, and vast, untapped energy sources. In response, the Tower Delver Organization was founded to manage exploration and extract these valuable discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Welcome Recruit&quot;</strong></p>", "short_description": "Embark on a 32-player Mecha adventure that unfolds over 3 real-world days.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560720/84f6991d371c83e229fd11b1594a16a01f2e26a2/header.jpg?t=1787719482", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea